{"id":1084,"slug":"the-last-metro","title":"The Last Metro","year":1980,"country":"France","duration":131,"spine":462,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/1084-the-last-metro","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/3b542aa4345014825677034e88a86e6d/n8W6S9aQt25iXGj6YmmCmbuqM3Pz1k_large.jpg","description":"Gérard Depardieu and Catherine Deneuve star as members of a French theater company living under the German occupation during World War II in François Truffaut’s gripping, humanist character study. Against all odds—a Jewish theater manager in hiding; a leading man who’s in the Resistance; increasingly restrictive Nazi oversight—the troupe believes the show must go on. Equal parts romance, historical tragedy, and even comedy, The Last Metro (Le dernier métro) is Truffaut’s ultimate tribute to art overcoming adversity. ","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"François Truffaut","slug":"francois-truffaut"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Catherine Deneuve","role":"Marion Steiner","slug":"catherine-deneuve"},{"actor":"Gérard Depardieu","role":"Bernard Granger","slug":"gerard-depardieu"},{"actor":"Jean Poiret","role":"Jean-Loup Cottins","slug":"jean-poiret"},{"actor":"Andréa Ferréol","role":"Arlette Guillaume","slug":"andrea-ferreol"},{"actor":"Paulette Dubost","role":"Germaine Fabre","slug":"paulette-dubost"},{"actor":"Jean-Louis Richard","role":"Daxiat","slug":"jean-louis-richard"},{"actor":"Sabine Haudepin","role":"Nadine Marsac","slug":"sabine-haudepin"},{"actor":"Maurice Risch","role":"Raymond","slug":"maurice-risch"},{"actor":"Heinz Bennent","role":"Lucas Steiner","slug":"heinz-bennent"},{"actor":"Christian Baltauss","role":"Bernard’s replacement","slug":"christian-baltauss"},{"actor":"René Dupré","role":"Valentin","slug":"rene-dupre"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"François Truffaut","slug":"francois-truffaut"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"François Truffaut","slug":"francois-truffaut"},{"role":"Screenplay","person":"Suzanne Schiffman","s